    "id": 3963437604,
    "type": null,
    "body": "Review addressed; ready to merge at `900ac3fb3`.\n\n- `ddacf712f`: `copy_object_strings()` duplicates `char_sdesc`, and\n  `Test_gameplay_object_editor_copy_frees_an_object_with_no_prototype` covers it (thread above,\n  resolved).\n- `900ac3fb3`: the plan's record of the review.\n- On `ddacf712f`: `make -j16 test` 2041 pass; `scripts/ci/local/run.py --base gitlab/master` 33 of\n  33 jobs (281 s). `900ac3fb3` adds the record only.\n- Git: no second tag, as the plan says (`object-save-fixes-p3` marks the hand-off; review fixes\n  are the commits after it); merge commit, no squash. MR !26's branch has `900ac3fb3` merged in\n  (`15f66c7c9`, matrix 33 of 33 on `5328a0005`), so the order is !25, then !26 without a rebase.",
